        m_UnmaskedViews: []
      m_Summary: 
      m_Description: 
      m_InstructionBoxTitle: 
      m_InstructionText: 
      m_TutorialButtonText: 
    - m_Type: 0
      Title:
        m_Untranslated: Your own milestones
      Text:
        m_Untranslated: '<b>EndAtFirstFrameAsync</b> records a milestone when the
          scene is loaded, and ends the start once its first frame is rendered. With
          Addressables installed, it also takes the handle of <b>Addressables.LoadSceneAsync</b>.
          <b>End</b> and <b>EndAfterRenderingAsync</b> end the start at once, or
          once the current frame is rendered.


          Mark the steps of your
          own start with <b>StartupTimeline.Mark("name")</b>, for example when your
          content is ready: the measure shows how long each one takes.'
      m_CodeSample: 
